{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"bioRxiv DOI:10.1101/2025.04.22.650006; 最终发表版本 DOI:10.1038/s41531-026-01280-4; PMID:41654501\",\n    \"title\": \"Deep neurobehavioral phenotyping uncovers neural fingerprints of locomotor deficits in Parkinson’s disease\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"published\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": \"重要版本差异：用户附件实际为bioRxiv v1，上传PDF首页标题为“Uncovering the Neural Fingerprint of Akinetic States in a Parkinson’s Disease Rodent Model”，发表于2025-04-26，未包含人类STN-FoG实验。用户提供的标题对应后续bioRxiv v2及2026年2月7日发表的npj Parkinson's Disease正式论文。正式版本保留原有6-OHDA大鼠研究，并增加2例PD患者的STN记录与FoG验证。依据相同DOI谱系、作者及大鼠研究内容，判定为同一研究的不同版本，而非独立重复研究。【turn208529search1】【turn208529search2】【turn803640search0】\",\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"DOI:10.1101/2025.04.22.650006 / DOI:10.1038/s41531-026-01280-4，同一研究版本候选\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"动物队列：6-OHDA单侧损毁大鼠n=6及Sham大鼠n=8；人类队列：TRR295 ReTune项目中的2例男性PD患者，双侧STN-DBS。\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"正式发表版本同时报告两个不同实验队列。动物队列为6-OHDA大鼠及Sham对照，动物数据集DOI为10.5281/zenodo.15163493。人类队列为2例男性PD患者，年龄68岁和70岁，均接受双侧STN-DBS，数据采集属于Collaborative Research Centre TRR 295项目24778381。人类数据可向作者合理申请获取。论文未提供患者身份标识及详细招募日期，无法进一步确认与其他ReTune研究的患者队列重叠情况。\",\n    \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_RAT_01_HBLG_STATE\",\n      \"design\": \"原始动物实验；6-OHDA单侧MFB损毁模型；Sham对照；视频行为标注与M1 ECoG同步记录；状态相关神经功率比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"雄性Sprague-Dawley大鼠。PD模型n=6，Sham n=8。该神经比较针对6-OHDA动物。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 14,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 6,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 2,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"患者相关分母不适用，研究对象为动物。N=75是另一项分析中使用的akinesia事件数，不是本比较的事件数。全文报告整体多模态数据集包含55 runs，但未报告本LMM比较实际使用的试次数。每只动物有2枚M1 ECoG螺钉；另植入2支STN LFP探针，但未分析其数据。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"akinesia：作者定义为几乎完全缺乏任何类型的运动。不是临床视频确认的患者FOG，也未进一步划分trembling、shuffling等亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"not_applicable（动物模型）\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"6-OHDA损毁模型；6-OHDA剂量8 μg；Sham接受不含6-OHDA的相同溶液。未报告左旋多巴药物状态实验。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"每只大鼠双侧STN区域植入LFP探针，但作者明确说明未分析STN电极数据；未进行DBS刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"15×140 cm runway任务。大鼠被训练在跑道两端之间行走，直至完成15次成功穿越或每只动物达到20分钟记录时间。视频记录自然发生的gait、stationary movement和akinesia。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧初级运动皮层M1 ECoG，每侧1枚不锈钢螺钉电极。STN双侧LFP探针仅植入，未分析。\",\n      \"measure\": \"M1 ECoG高beta-低gamma（HB-LG）频段功率，使用PSD计算20–42 Hz频段平均功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"原始ECoG采样率24414.1 Hz；PSD分析范围5–100 Hz；提取20–42 Hz作为HB-LG频段；Fig.1状态PSD采用每次状态出现的前1.5秒。图中功率以Z-score展示。未报告独立的个体基线归一化细节。\",\n      \"finding\": \"6-OHDA大鼠在akinesia状态下的M1 HB-LG功率显著高于stationary movement和gait状态，两项比较均P<0.001。该结果是皮层ECoG证据，不是STN LFP证据。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"akinesia相对于stationary movement：功率增加，P<0.001；相对于gait：功率增加，P<0.001。未报告组间差值、效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Linear Mixed Model。事件类型为固定效应，记录日期嵌套于受试动物作为随机效应。重复状态事件不能视为独立动物样本。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性动物电生理研究领域偏倚评估，非经验证的正式工具。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"PD模型n=6、Sham n=8，均为雄性大鼠；未报告随机分组及动物纳入排除的详细过程。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Animal model and surgical procedures，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"通过视频人工标注状态，但未报告标注者数量、盲法或标注者间一致性。akinesia与临床FOG不能直接等同。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Locomotor states labeling，p.8；Discussion，p.7。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用Intan digitizing headstage以减少运动伪迹，但未报告定量伪迹排除标准或残余运动伪迹评估。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Neural data recording，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"状态相关功率变化可能与运动状态、静止程度及病变状态共同变化；未通过独立干预分离FOG特异性神经机制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Basic processing of locomotor deficits，p.2。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用LMM处理记录日期嵌套于动物的结构，但具体状态事件数及每只动物贡献的事件数未完整报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.2，Fig.1h。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告了两个状态比较的P值，但该LMM比较是否进行了多重比较校正未明确说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.2，Fig.1h。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条为状态相关功率比较，不是预测模型；独立外部验证不适用。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.2。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"全文报告多种神经特征，但未见预注册分析计划，无法判断是否存在选择性报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.2–5。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"最重要的适用性限制：作者虽然植入STN LFP探针，但明确没有分析STN数据。此结果不能作为STN神经活动与患者FOG关系的直接证据。20–42 Hz在正式版本中定义为HB-LG，而非直接等同于人类13–20 Hz beta。\",\n      \"quote\": \"increased activity specifically during states of akinesia, compared to stationary movement (P < 0.001) and gait (P < 0.001)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Basic processing of locomotor deficits confirms established neural biomarkers in 6-OHDA rats【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"2\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.1g–h\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_RAT_02_HJORTH_COMPLEXITY_ONSET\",\n      \"design\": \"原始动物电生理研究；事件触发平均分析；围绕akinesia onset计算M1 ECoG时间域特征变化。\",\n      \"population\": \"6-OHDA单侧损毁雄性Sprague-Dawley大鼠，PD模型n=6；Sham队列n=8。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 14,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 6,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 2,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"患者及临床FOG分母不适用。作者报告N=75个akinesia episodes用于时间变化分析，但未报告每只动物分别贡献的事件数。55 runs为整体数据集中的记录数量，不等于本分析的FOG事件数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"akinesia，几乎完全缺乏运动；不是经临床确认的FOG。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"not_applicable（动物模型）\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"6-OHDA单侧损毁模型；未报告药物状态变化。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN LFP探针植入但未分析；没有DBS刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"Runway自然行走任务；视频标注akinesia onset，提取事件前后神经特征。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左侧M1 ECoG，6-OHDA损毁侧。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Hjorth complexity，时间域波形复杂度指标，反映信号偏离纯正弦波的程度。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"神经特征采样率200 Hz；事件对齐时间窗为akinesia onset前后约−1至+1秒；N=75个akinesia episodes；图中展示归一化特征的平均时间曲线及标准差。未明确报告独立事件基线定义。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Hjorth complexity在akinesia episode开始之前逐渐增加，并在akinesia onset时再次出现明显增加。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正向调制；事件平均曲线显示增加，报告均值及标准差；未报告独立效应量、置信区间或该时间曲线的P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"以75个akinesia episodes为事件对齐单位进行平均时间曲线分析，展示mean±SD。未报告该分析是否在统计推断中进一步考虑事件嵌套于动物的层级结构。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性动物电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"只有6只PD模型大鼠；均为雄性；动物选择及随机化过程报告有限。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Animal model，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件起点由视频人工标注；未报告标注者间一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Locomotor states labeling，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用headstage减少运动伪迹，但未报告事件前后残余伪迹的定量评估。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Neural data recording，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"复杂度变化与整体运动停止可能共同发生，不能单独证明其特异性编码FOG机制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Identified neural features，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"75个事件来自6只动物；事件级平均不能自动等同于75个独立生物学样本。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5，Fig.4c。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"该事件触发时间曲线没有报告独立显著性检验。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Fig.4c，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条为描述性事件触发分析，不是独立预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"从108项神经特征中筛选重点特征，未见预注册计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.3–5。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果描述的是akinesia onset附近的皮层时间域信号变化，不能直接称为人类FOG发生前的STN预测信号。未报告患者事件级结果，也未证明Hjorth complexity在临床FOG之前具有预测价值。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Hjorth complexity underwent a gradual increase shortly before the beginning of the akinetic episode, and again at the onset\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Identified neural features modulate during akinetic state【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"5\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4c\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_RAT_03_HJORTH_COMPLEXITY_STATE\",\n      \"design\": \"原始动物电生理研究；PD模型内部不同运动状态的神经特征比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"6-OHDA单侧损毁雄性Sprague-Dawley大鼠；PD模型n=6。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 14,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 6,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 2,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"动物研究，不适用患者分母。未报告本状态比较中各状态的具体事件数及每只动物的事件贡献。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"akinesia；作者定义为几乎完全缺乏任何运动。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"6-OHDA损毁模型；无药物状态比较。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN探针植入但未分析；未进行DBS刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"Runway任务；比较akinesia、stationary movement和gait状态。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"左侧M1 ECoG，6-OHDA损毁侧。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Hjorth complexity，时间域特征。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"神经特征以200 Hz采样，5 ms特征间隔；数据按特征列进行Z-score标准化。状态比较的具体单次窗口长度未在该统计结果中明确报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Hjorth complexity在akinesia状态下显著上调，相对于stationary movement及gait状态均表现为增加。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"显著上调；作者报告相关t检验及12项比较的Bonferroni-Holm校正，但未给出该特征每项比较的精确P值、效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Related t-test；12项检验（3种运动状态×4种选定神经特征）采用Bonferroni-Holm校正。具体配对统计单位未充分说明。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性动物电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"PD动物样本量为6，且仅使用雄性大鼠。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Animal model，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"人工视频标注；没有报告标注者间一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Locomotor states labeling，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告定量运动伪迹排除及信号质量指标。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Neural data recording，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"Hjorth complexity可能反映运动状态本身，不能据此确定其FOG特异性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"状态事件重复出现；统计方法未充分说明是否以动物为独立配对单位。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"明确报告12项检验的Bonferroni-Holm校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis of selected features，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条是特征状态比较，不是独立预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"从108项神经特征中筛选重点特征，未见预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.3–5。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"Hjorth complexity在动物akinesia中有组内状态差异，但该结果不能说明其在患者STN中必然呈相同变化，也不能证明其对临床FOG具有特异性。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Hjorth Complexity was significantly up-modulated specifically during states of akinesia\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Identified neural features modulate during akinetic state【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"5\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4e\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_RAT_04_HJORTH_MOBILITY_ONSET\",\n      \"design\": \"原始动物电生理研究；事件触发平均分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"6-OHDA单侧损毁雄性Sprague-Dawley大鼠，PD模型n=6。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 14,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 6,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 2,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"N=75为akinesia事件数，不是临床FOG事件数；未报告各动物贡献的具体事件数量。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"akinesia，近乎完全缺乏运动。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"6-OHDA损毁模型；无药物状态比较。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN LFP探针植入但未分析；无DBS刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"Runway任务；视频确认akinesia onset。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧M1 ECoG，未损毁侧。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Hjorth mobility，时间域频率内容指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"200 Hz特征采样；akinesia onset前后约−1至+1秒；N=75个事件；平均曲线及标准差；未报告独立基线窗口。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Hjorth mobility在akinesia onset之前逐渐下降，并在事件开始期间继续表现为下降。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向调制；报告事件平均时间曲线，未报告效应量、置信区间或时间曲线显著性检验。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"事件触发平均，N=75个akinesia episodes；展示mean±SD。未报告事件嵌套于动物的独立统计模型。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性动物电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"6只PD模型大鼠，雄性动物；选择及随机化信息有限。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Animal model，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"人工视频标注；未报告标注者一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Locomotor states labeling，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供定量残余运动伪迹评估。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Neural data recording，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"mobility可能与整体运动水平相关，不能直接解释为FOG特异性信号。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"75个事件来自6只动物；未报告动物层级聚类校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Fig.4d，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件触发时间曲线未报告独立显著性检验。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Fig.4d，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"不是预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未见预注册的时间域特征分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.3–5。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果只证明动物M1 ECoG的Hjorth mobility在akinesia onset附近下降。不能将其标记为人类FOG发生前的STN信号，也没有证据说明该特征在FOG之前具有预测能力。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Hjorth mobility displayed a gradual decline preceding and during the akinetic episode onset\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Identified neural features modulate during akinetic state【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"5\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4d\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_RAT_05_GAMMA_STATE\",\n      \"design\": \"原始动物电生理研究；不同运动状态间神经频域特征比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"6-OHDA单侧损毁雄性Sprague-Dawley大鼠，PD模型n=6。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 14,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 6,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 2,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"动物研究，不适用患者分母；未报告本比较每种状态具体使用的事件数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"akinesia，近乎完全缺乏运动。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"6-OHDA损毁模型；无药物状态比较。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN LFP探针植入但未分析；未进行DBS刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"Runway任务；比较akinesia与gait状态。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"右侧M1 ECoG，未损毁侧。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Gamma amplitude，FFT计算的频域振幅。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Gamma频段边界在正文中未明确报告；使用FFT振幅特征；特征采样率200 Hz；状态比较采用Z-score展示。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Gamma amplitude在akinesia状态下相对于gait状态显著下降。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向调制；作者报告统计显著，但正文未给出该比较的精确P值、效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Related t-test；12项比较进行Bonferroni-Holm校正；具体配对单位未充分说明。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性动物电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"PD模型n=6，雄性动物；随机化及详细选择过程未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Animal model，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"人工视频标注，无报告标注者间一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Locomotor states labeling，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告残余运动伪迹定量排除标准。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Neural data recording，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"未区分gamma下降是病理状态特异性变化还是运动水平下降的伴随变化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"重复运动状态数据；配对统计的生物学独立单位未明确说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告12项比较的Bonferroni-Holm校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis of selected features，p.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条为频域特征比较，不是预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.5。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未见预注册方案；从多项特征中选择重点结果。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.3–5。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是后续跨物种比较的重要参照：大鼠M1 gamma在akinesia期间下降，而人类STN gamma在临床FOG期间上升。两者记录解剖位置、物种、行为表型和频段定义并不相同，不能直接视为同一个信号机制。\",\n      \"quote\": \"gamma amplitude demonstrated a down-modulation during episodes of akinesia, in comparison to the gait state\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Identified neural features modulate during akinetic state【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"5\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4e\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_HUMAN_01_STN_HJORTH_COMPLEXITY\",\n      \"design\": \"原始临床观察性电生理研究；2例PD患者双侧STN-DBS植入；同步STN LFP、步态运动学和视频FOG标注；患者内FOG与gait比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"2例男性PD患者，年龄68岁及70岁，均存在步态障碍和FOG。显著神经调制主要出现在Subject 2；Subject 1未显示明确神经调制。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 2,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 2,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 27,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 6,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"临床视频评审识别Subject 1有20次、Subject 2有8次FOG，共28次；神经特征分析中使用Subject 1的19次及Subject 2的8次，共27次。少1次的原因未报告。论文报告6个STN通道（左侧3个、右侧3个），但未充分说明该数字是每位患者还是整体统计。Methods说明双侧各记录3种非相邻接触组合。每位患者完成10次往返行走，但未明确将其定义为独立trial。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"临床FOG，视频确认；未报告akinetic、trembling-in-place、shuffling等具体亚型。两名临床医生独立评估并解决分歧。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"OFF-FOG：两名患者在Med-Off/Stim-Off状态出现FOG；作者报告药物及刺激均可改善步态，但未明确患者是否存在ON-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off：实验前隔夜停用所有多巴胺能药物；Stim-Off：关闭DBS至少1小时。两名患者均在该状态完成测试。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS，Medtronic Sensight B33005电极及Percept PC植入式脉冲发生器。测试期间刺激关闭。记录双侧非相邻接触对LFP：[0–2]、[1–3]、[0–3]。未报告刺激频率、幅度、脉宽及临床启用刺激参数。Subject 2电极均准确位于STN。\",\n      \"task\": \"患者赤足在约10 m步道上以自选速度往返行走10次，包括直行和转弯。视频同步记录。两名有运动障碍临床经验的医生独立识别FOG；FOG标准包括指令后1秒内未能启动、出现尝试但无法继续行走，或无明显外部原因的突然行走中断。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP。研究报告共6个STN通道，左侧3个、右侧3个；Subject 2电极准确位于STN。每侧记录非相邻接触组合。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN LFP Hjorth complexity，时间域波形复杂度指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"LFP采样率250 Hz；使用py_neuromodulation提取神经特征并重采样至100 Hz；计算每个FoG及gait episode的特征平均值。Hjorth complexity无独立频段定义；未明确报告基线归一化方法及特征内部窗口长度。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Subject 2在FOG期间的STN Hjorth complexity相对于gait显著上调，P=0.004。Subject 1未显示明确神经调制。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Subject 2：上调，P=0.004；对4项特征比较进行Bonferroni校正。未报告效应量、置信区间或患者间汇总效应。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Within-patient, trial-constrained permutation test；每个episode计算特征平均值；4项特征进行Bonferroni校正。统计推断为患者内比较，不是2例患者的组水平推断。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性临床电生理研究领域偏倚评估，非经验证的正式工具。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅2例男性PD患者，来自单一项目数据；未报告更大规模连续入组或对照组。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"两名临床医生独立评估视频，分歧经讨论解决；未报告kappa或其他一致性统计。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"记录250 Hz LFP，排除一个6秒强STN伪迹区间；Subject 1右侧电极定位偏离STN。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection and Human data analysis，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"所有测试均为Med-Off/Stim-Off；FOG多发生于转弯，作者进行了转弯相关信号检查，但没有药物及刺激状态间比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6；Methods，p.9；Supplementary Fig.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"27次FOG事件来自2名患者；采用患者内置换检验，不支持将事件数视为独立患者样本，也不能支持群体水平结论。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6；Methods—Human data analysis，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"对4项神经特征进行Bonferroni校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条是患者内特征比较而非临床预测模型；没有独立人类队列外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"论文说明为展示选择beta调制最大的通道；完整通道结果放在补充材料，仍存在通道选择及小样本报告偏倚可能。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data analysis，p.9；Supplementary Fig.4。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"仅Subject 2显示显著调制；总共只有2名患者。分析为FOG期间与gait期间的比较，而不是同一事件随后发生FOG之前的预测。因此不能标记为pre_FOG_event_associated，也不能证明该指标可提前预测冻结。Subject 1的右侧电极定位偏离STN，可能影响阴性结果。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Hjorth complexity was up-modulated (P = 0.004)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Modulation of identified neural correlates is confirmed during freezing of gait in a Parkinson’s patient【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"6\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5e\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.4（完整STN通道）；Supplementary Fig.8（电极定位）\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_HUMAN_02_STN_HJORTH_MOBILITY\",\n      \"design\": \"原始临床观察性电生理研究；患者内FOG与gait期间STN LFP时间域特征比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"2例男性PD患者，年龄68岁及70岁；显著调制仅见于Subject 2。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 2,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 2,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 27,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 6,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"视频确认28次FOG，神经分析使用27次；Subject 1由20次减少至19次的原因未报告。6个STN通道的统计范围未明确说明；患者每人完成10次往返行走，但独立trial定义未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"视频确认临床FOG，未进一步报告冻结亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"OFF-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off，隔夜停用多巴胺能药物；Stim-Off至少1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN Sensight B33005电极，Percept PC植入式发生器；记录期间刺激关闭。LFP双侧接触组合[0–2]、[1–3]、[0–3]。无刺激参数可提取。\",\n      \"task\": \"赤足10 m步道往返行走10次，自选速度；视频同步；FOG由两名临床医生独立评审。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP；Subject 2双侧电极准确位于STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN LFP Hjorth mobility，时间域频率内容指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"LFP 250 Hz采样，神经特征重采样100 Hz；每个FOG及gait episode计算平均特征值。Hjorth mobility不属于单一振荡频段；未报告基线归一化细节。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Subject 2在FOG期间的STN Hjorth mobility相对于gait显著下降，P=0.004。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Subject 2：负向调制，P=0.004；Bonferroni校正4项比较；未报告效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者内trial-constrained permutation test；按episode计算特征均值；Bonferroni校正4项比较；没有患者间组水平统计。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性临床电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅2例男性PD患者，缺少独立验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"双临床医生独立视频评估，但无标注一致性系数。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"Subject 1右侧电极偏离STN；有强伪迹排除，但缺少全面信号质量指标。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data analysis，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅Med-Off/Stim-Off状态；任务包含转弯及直行，未在更大样本中充分分层。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，p.9；Supplementary Fig.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件来自2名患者，患者内置换检验不能替代患者层面的独立重复。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6；Methods，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"4项神经特征采用Bonferroni校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"非预测模型；未进行独立患者队列验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"展示通道涉及最大beta调制的选择；完整通道结果见补充材料。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，p.9；Supplementary Fig.4。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该指标在动物M1 ECoG及一名患者STN LFP中方向一致，但临床证据仅来自一名患者。尚不能确定Hjorth mobility下降是否具有FOG特异性，或是否反映更一般的病理性运动状态转换。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Hjorth mobility was downregulated (P = 0.004)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Modulation of identified neural correlates is confirmed during freezing of gait in a Parkinson’s patient【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"6\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5e\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.4\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_HUMAN_03_STN_BETA\",\n      \"design\": \"原始临床观察性电生理研究；STN LFP频域特征与视频确认FOG事件比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"2例男性PD患者，年龄68岁及70岁；显著神经调制见于Subject 2。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 2,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 2,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 27,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 6,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"神经分析中FOG事件为Subject 1的19次及Subject 2的8次；视频最初确认总计28次。6个STN通道的分母范围未明确；trial数量未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"临床视频确认FOG，具体亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"OFF-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off（隔夜停药）；Stim-Off（至少1小时）。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS；Sensight B33005电极，Percept PC植入式发生器；记录时刺激关闭。记录双侧非相邻接触对；未报告实际刺激频率、幅度、脉宽。\",\n      \"task\": \"10 m步道赤足往返行走10次，包含直行和转弯；FOG由两名临床医生视频评审。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP；Subject 2的电极准确位于STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN LFP beta amplitude，FFT振幅。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"正文明确报告beta频段为13–20 Hz。LFP原始采样率250 Hz，神经特征重采样100 Hz，每个FOG及gait episode计算平均特征值；未报告基线归一化方法。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Subject 2在FOG期间STN beta amplitude上调，P=0.006；Subject 1没有明确神经调制。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Subject 2：beta上调，P=0.006；Bonferroni校正4项比较；无效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Within-patient trial-constrained permutation test；以episode均值比较FOG与gait；4项特征Bonferroni校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性临床电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅2名男性PD患者；无独立对照或验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"两名临床医生独立视频评估，未报告一致性系数。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"存在一个右侧电极定位偏离STN的患者；记录中排除强伪迹区间。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，p.9；Supplementary Fig.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物及刺激状态固定为OFF，无法判断ON状态下beta变化是否相同。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"27个分析事件来自2名患者；患者内置换不能形成患者群体层面的独立证据。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6；Methods，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"4项特征比较进行Bonferroni校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有进行人类beta预测模型的独立外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"可视化时选择beta调制最大的通道，存在通道选择偏倚可能。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，p.9。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"方向上与大鼠20–42 Hz HB-LG功率在akinesia期间升高一致，但频段边界不同：大鼠为20–42 Hz HB-LG，人类为13–20 Hz beta，不能直接视为相同频段的重复验证。人类显著结果仅见于一名患者。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the beta band was up-modulated (P = 0.006)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Modulation of identified neural correlates is confirmed during freezing of gait in a Parkinson’s patient【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"6\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5e\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.4\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_HUMAN_04_STN_GAMMA\",\n      \"design\": \"原始临床观察性电生理研究；STN LFP gamma特征与视频确认FOG事件比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"2例男性PD患者，年龄68岁及70岁；显著调制见于Subject 2。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 2,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 2,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 27,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 6,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"27个FOG事件进入神经分析；初始视频标注28次。gamma频段边界未在正文明确报告；6个STN通道的计数范围不明确。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"临床视频确认FOG，亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"OFF-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off，隔夜停用多巴胺能药物；Stim-Off至少1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS，Sensight B33005电极，Percept PC植入式发生器；实验时刺激关闭；未报告刺激频率、幅度及脉宽。\",\n      \"task\": \"10 m步道赤足往返行走，直行与转弯；视频确认FOG。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP；Subject 2电极准确位于STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN LFP gamma amplitude，FFT振幅。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"LFP采样率250 Hz，神经特征重采样100 Hz；每个FOG及gait episode计算平均特征值。Gamma具体频段边界未报告，不能根据领域惯例补充。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Subject 2在FOG期间的STN gamma amplitude显著上调，P=0.004。该方向与大鼠M1 ECoG中akinesia期间gamma下降的结果相反。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Subject 2：gamma上调，P=0.004；Bonferroni校正4项比较；未报告效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Within-patient trial-constrained permutation test；每个episode计算均值；Bonferroni校正4项特征比较。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性临床电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅2例男性PD患者，缺少独立复制队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"双医生视频评审，但未报告标注一致性系数。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"存在电极定位偏离STN及伪迹排除问题；gamma频段定义也未充分报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，p.9；Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"人类记录部位为STN，而动物为M1；物种及行为任务不同，无法直接归因于单一生物学机制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，pp.5–6；Discussion，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者内事件级分析仅来自2人，不能将事件数当作独立患者样本。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data analysis，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"4项特征比较采用Bonferroni校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条不是预测模型；没有独立患者验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"展示通道依据beta调制选择；gamma具体频段边界未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，p.9；Fig.5e。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是论文中最明确的跨物种方向冲突：大鼠M1 gamma在akinesia期间下降，人类STN gamma在FOG期间上升。不能简单判定其中一个结果错误。可区分的竞争性解释（以下为分析推论，并非本文直接验证）：1. 解剖部位依赖：M1与STN的gamma调制可能不同；可在同一患者同步记录皮层与STN。2. 行为表型依赖：动物完全akinesia与临床FOG可能不是同一种运动状态；可分别比较FOG、非FOG静止及普通步态减速。3. 频段及特征定义差异：人类gamma边界未报告；可预先统一频段边界、滤波和分析窗口后重复检验。当前只有一名患者显示该调制，不能形成稳定的人类gamma机制结论。\",\n      \"quote\": \"However in contrast to rats, the gamma band was up-modulated (P = 0.004)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Modulation of identified neural correlates is confirmed during freezing of gait in a Parkinson’s patient【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"6\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5e\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.4\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"GARULLI_HUMAN_05_STN_NONRESPONSE\",\n      \"design\": \"原始临床观察性电生理研究；患者内阴性结果及电极解剖位置评估。\",\n      \"population\": \"Subject 1：男性PD患者，年龄68岁，存在FOG；右侧STN电极定位偏离STN。整体人类研究队列为2例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 2,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 2,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 2,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 27,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 6,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"Subject 1初始视频标注20次FOG，神经分析使用19次；原因未报告。研究报告6个STN通道，但其计数是否为每位患者或整体统计不明确。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"临床视频确认FOG，具体冻结亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"OFF-FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-Off，隔夜停药；Stim-Off至少1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧Sensight B33005 STN-DBS电极，Percept PC植入式发生器；刺激关闭。Subject 1右侧电极定位在STN外侧，影像重建显示右侧所有接触点均位于STN外侧。\",\n      \"task\": \"10 m步道赤足往返行走10次，包含直行及转弯；FOG由两名临床医生独立视频标注。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP；Subject 1右侧电极位于STN外侧，存在解剖定位问题。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN神经特征整体面板：Hjorth complexity、Hjorth mobility、beta amplitude及gamma amplitude。论文对Subject 1的无调制结果未分别提供每个指标的定量估计。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"LFP原始采样率250 Hz；神经特征重采样100 Hz；每个FOG及gait episode计算特征平均值。Beta定义为13–20 Hz；gamma边界未报告；Hjorth指标无独立频段。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Subject 1未表现出明确的神经特征调制。作者指出其右侧电极位置偏离STN，可能影响记录质量及阴性结果的解释。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"无明确调制；未报告该患者各特征的独立效应量、P值及置信区间。不能将其直接解释为STN生理机制不存在。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者内trial-constrained permutation分析框架；Subject 1未报告各特征单独的统计量。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性临床电生理研究领域偏倚评估。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅2例患者，阴性患者的电极定位存在明显问题。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavior_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"双医生视频确认FOG，但没有报告标注一致性统计。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"Subject 1右侧电极所有接触点均位于STN外侧，存在直接的记录位置有效性问题。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data collection，p.9；Supplementary Fig.8。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"电极位置与患者生理状态共同影响信号，无法将无调制单独解释为生物学阴性结果。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"单个患者的多个事件不能替代患者群体层面的重复验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Human data analysis，p.9。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"low\",\n            \"reason\": \"整体4项神经特征比较采用Bonferroni校正，但Subject 1的独立统计值未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"不是独立预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，p.6。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告Subject 1各指标的详细数值和独立P值；通道展示存在beta调制筛选。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Fig.5e；Supplementary Fig.4。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是一个重要的阴性证据，但不能等同于真正的STN生理阴性。作者指出Subject 1右侧电极定位偏离STN，可能造成信号采集位置偏差。一个可检验的竞争解释是解剖定位而非患者生物学差异导致无调制；可以通过术后影像接触点重建、仅使用明确位于STN内的接触点，以及增加定位可靠的患者重复实验来区分。另一种解释是患者间真实生理异质性，但当前样本不足以确认。\",\n      \"quote\": \"one subject did not display any neural modulation\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Modulation of identified neural correlates is confirmed during freezing of gait in a Parkinson’s patient；Discussion【turn904862view0】\",\n        \"page\": \"6\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5e\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.4（通道）；Supplementary Fig.8（电极解剖定位）\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3df74734-253c-4c85-bb9f-bcd876a93b8c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T105819007650Z", "elapsed_seconds": 701.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:10:00.408479+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "